menu "AstCalendar"

config ASTCALENDAR_INACTIVE
    bool "Make AstCalendar inherit from InactiveModule (no dedicated thread)"
    default n
    help
        If enabled, AstCalendar will be built as an InactiveModule (sharing the
        main ActiveModule thread context chain) instead of spawning its own
        ActiveModule thread. Use this to reduce thread count / RAM.

endmenu
